# Rule 3: a loop is a fold only when its end is stated before it starts
# (Table 7, a counted for or a range-for over a sized range; Meyer and Ritchie
# 1967, the LOOP language, whose count is fixed on entry and whose programs
# are the primitive recursive functions).  Refused, so a finding:
#   - a while or a do;
#   - a for that is not counted: one integer counter declared in its init,
#     the condition counter < bound, the increment ++counter, the bound an
#     integer literal, a parameter, a const variable or std::array's size();
#     in the body no break, return or goto, and no assignment, ++ or -- of
#     the counter or the bound;
#   - a range-for over anything but an array or a std::array (a sized range
#     whose size is its type's), or with a break, return or goto inside.
# A loop that passes is Table 7's derived form, fold_left over iota(0uz, n) or
# over the range, its locals the state; a body that writes a local is that
# state (Rule 1's deny-rules close every channel by which it could leave).
# Conservative: a jump in a nested statement or a closure counts, a non-const
# local bound and a sized range other than an array do not pass.
match stmt(isExpansionInMainFile(), anyOf(whileStmt(), doStmt(), forStmt(unless(forStmt(hasLoopInit(declStmt(hasSingleDecl(varDecl(hasType(isInteger())).bind("i")))), hasCondition(binaryOperator(hasOperatorName("<"), hasLHS(ignoringParenImpCasts(declRefExpr(to(varDecl(equalsBoundNode("i")))))), hasRHS(ignoringParenImpCasts(anyOf(integerLiteral(), declRefExpr(to(varDecl(anyOf(parmVarDecl(), hasType(isConstQualified()))).bind("n"))), cxxMemberCallExpr(callee(cxxMethodDecl(hasName("size"), ofClass(hasName("::std::array")))))))))), hasIncrement(unaryOperator(hasOperatorName("++"), hasUnaryOperand(ignoringParenImpCasts(declRefExpr(to(varDecl(equalsBoundNode("i")))))))), hasBody(unless(hasDescendant(stmt(anyOf(breakStmt(), returnStmt(), gotoStmt(), binaryOperator(isAssignmentOperator(), hasLHS(ignoringParenImpCasts(declRefExpr(to(varDecl(anyOf(equalsBoundNode("i"), equalsBoundNode("n")))))))), unaryOperator(hasAnyOperatorName("++", "--"), hasUnaryOperand(ignoringParenImpCasts(declRefExpr(to(varDecl(anyOf(equalsBoundNode("i"), equalsBoundNode("n")))))))))))))))), cxxForRangeStmt(unless(cxxForRangeStmt(hasRangeInit(ignoringParenImpCasts(expr(hasType(hasUnqualifiedDesugaredType(anyOf(constantArrayType(), recordType(hasDeclaration(classTemplateSpecializationDecl(hasName("::std::array")))))))))), hasBody(unless(hasDescendant(stmt(anyOf(breakStmt(), returnStmt(), gotoStmt()))))))))), hasAncestor(scope))
